                                                "sense_id": "1ce393ac-2f4f-3a3a-b6bb-29eee07e9185",
                                                "text": "He said that the geometry of the dream-place he saw was abnormal, non-Euclidean, and loathsomely redolent of spheres and dimensions apart from ours."
